OL,5,G0300 Van Gogh By Vincent
OL,6,     FIn a career that lasted only ten
OL,7,     Fyears, Vincent van Gogh painted
OL,8,     Fone subject more than any other:
OL,9,     Fhimself. This is the story of
OL,10,     FVincent told using eight of his
OL,11,     Fself-portraits.
